 "remarks": "Discover exceptional coastal living in the heart of Harbor View, one of Norwalk's most treasured waterfront communities. Set on a coveted corner lot, this meticulously remodeled Colonial blends timeless character with refined, effortless living. A warm foyer opens to a sun-filled living room with coffered ceiling, anchored by a wood burning fireplace, with sight lines to a window-wrapped corner office and modular first-floor rooms w/full bath. The oversized designer chef's kitchen with Prof Viking double range, impressive island w/Pietra Cardosa Stone & Swedish pantry flow into a gracious dining room and out to an expansive deck overlooking a private landscaped yard and Harborview's only full-size in-ground pool. The serene main-level primary suite offers an en-suite bath & dressing room. Addl porch entrance leads to a private treatment studio half bath & laundry, currently used for a massage therapy practice, offering flexibility for home office, guest quarters or possible ADU. Upstairs, a Long Island Sound view & three inviting bedrooms & full bath complete the living quarters. FEMA-compliant & elevated w/ 2-car garage, utility room & abundant storage. Only steps to Long Island Sound, clubhouse, tennis, kayaking, paddle boarding, swimming, playground & ball field. 2 miles to Metro-North, 1 hour to Grand Central, with easy access to I-95, The SoNo Collection mall, SONO dining & nightlife. A rare opportunity to enjoy the distinctive Harbor View coastal lifestyle.",
